\subsection{Image Classification}
\noindent\textbf{Settings. }We follow the same training strategy in previous works with the only supervision being classification loss~\cite{deit, stvit, fan2023rmt, biformer, MLLA, cswin}. We train our models on ImageNet-1K~\cite{imagenet} from scratch.  The maximum rates of increasing stochastic depth~\cite{droppath} are set to 0.1/0.15/0.4/0.55 for MAViT-T/S/B/L, respectively. The batch size is set to 1024 and the max learning rate is 1e-3. We train all models for 300 epochs.

